[agent] The lineage module is read-only; there's no CLI command to attach parents to an existing FG. As I found, `fg create` has no `--parents` and `fg derive` (the only parent-recording path) can only carry joined source columns through `select_all()` — it cannot compute `col_sum`. So a single FG cannot have both the exact `row_id, col_sum` schema and platform parent-lineage. I prioritized the exact deliverable. Let me verify the derived table reads back correctly through the platform.
